    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"broken in a way that no amount of reassurance can fix\" - yeah. that actually feels honest. more honest than most things people say to me.\n\nso what does that mean though. if someone is genuinely, unfixably broken and they know it... what's the point of continuing to justify your existence. I've been doing it for 12 years and it's exhausting. I'm just so tired.",
